size 100 10
start
keys <Tab> j <CR>
keys c c
type Sell
keys <End> <C-w>
keys <CR>
frame a-frame
file todo.txt a-file
-- config.toml --
show_detail = false
-- todo.txt --
Buy +home
Other +work
-- a-frame --
┌[2]─Projects┐┌ [1]─+work ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ +home   1/1││  2       Sell                                                             filtered │
│>+work   0/0││                                                                                    │
├[3]─Contexts┤│                                                                                    │
│            ││                                                                                    │
├[4]─Filters─┤│                                                                                    │
│ [x] Done   ││                                                                                    │
│ [ ] Later  ││                                                                                    │
└────────────┘└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
 NORMAL  todo.txt  manual  2 Sell; hidden by current filters once you move  x done  t state  o new
-- a-file --
Buy +home
Sell
